{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-silver-expandable-blue-and-pink-butterfly-ring-2511-0074","content_id":"b0d2358c-565a-4519-9479-d0c3baa2e46c","description":"Product Safety Report for Silver Expandable Blue and Pink Butterfly Ring presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"fcd3326c-f176-4991-a339-9b8ff57bc7c3","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-13T14:15:59+00:00","id":"fcd3326c-f176-4991-a339-9b8ff57bc7c3","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-13T14:15:59+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6915e81f9d50fc2fe816178c/2511-0074-product-safety-report-silver-ring-blue-pink-butterfly.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Silver Expandable Blue and Pink Butterfly Ring</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as the nickel content is greater than the maximum permissible limit.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Jewellery - Rings</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Expandable ring with a blue and pink butterfly design, sold in a plastic bag.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_fcd3326c-f176-4991-a339-9b8ff57bc7c3\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6915e81f9d50fc2fe816178c/2511-0074-product-safety-report-silver-ring-blue-pink-butterfly.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as the nickel content is greater than the maximum permissible limit. Nickel is a sensitiser and can cause allergic reactions if present in products that come into direct and prolonged contact with the skin.   </p>\n\n<p>Further information on the health effects of nickel exposure can be accessed on Gov.uk at the following link:  <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nickel-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology\">https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nickel-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology</a>    </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the REACH Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0074</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-13T14:17:30Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"jewellery","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-13","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-13T14:17:30+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-silver-expandable-blue-and-pink-butterfly-ring-2511-0074","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-silver-expandable-blue-and-pink-